VERDICT: REJECTED

Next actions:
1) Replace index-walk parsing with key discovery (collect all present `items[<n>]` indices, sort, parse each), or enforce contiguous reindexing server-side before parse.
2) Add server-side validation for invoice/quotation submit: require at least one valid line item and reject/flash error otherwise.
3) Add regression tests for non-contiguous item indices and “delete first row then submit” flow for both invoices and quotations.

Memory note: `.agents/memory/invox-web.md` and `MEMORY.md` are mostly implementation-changelog / code-derivable environment details (run command, file layout) rather than durable cross-session lessons; trim to high-level durable decisions.

